               },
               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "We SHOULD more generically supply to the CryptoParams API a flag about padding, with teh default being just FINE right now.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "But we should allow specifyhing padding, or no padding (now its just defaulted - I think correctly).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Lowered from HIGH to medium priority - as this is just a small part of other cleanups to the API.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
